260922","day_label":"Tue 22 Sep 2026","definitions":"- **Arrival:** inferred from the trip-update feed. A feed lists the stops a vehicle has not served yet; when a stop drops off the list while the trip is still reported, the prediction in the last snapshot that listed it is taken as the arrival time.\n- **Counted stops:** intermediate stops of trips matched to the timetable. First stops (the feed echoes the timetable there) and last stops (the trip simply leaves the feed) are excluded; stops reported by several vehicles at once are excluded as ambiguous.\n- **On time:** delay between −60 s and +300 s; delay = inferred arrival − scheduled arrival.\n- **Late:** more than 5 min late. **Early:** more than 1 min early. On time, late and early add up to 100 % of the counted arrivals (up to rounding).\n- **Median delay:** the middle delay of the arrivals counted (negative = early).\n- **Route ranking:** route-hours with at least 30 arrivals, weighted by arrivals.\n- **Bus last stops** are measured separately from GPS positions and are not part of these numbers.","min_events":30,"ranking":[{"events":14427,"late_share":0.0979,"on_time_share":0.4693,"route_id":"2"},{"events":7607,"late_share":0.0578,"on_time_share":0.4997,"route_id":"5"},{"events":7811,"late_share":0.046,"on_time_share":0.5433,"route_id":"3"},{"events":9885,"late_share":0.0725,"on_time_share":0.5586,"route_id":"4"},{"events":8304,"late_share":0.0515,"on_time_share":0.7966,"route_id":"7"},{"events":2232,"late_share":0.1443,"on_time_share":0.8047,"route_id":"6X"},{"events":9674,"late_share":0.0912,"on_time_share":0.8596,"route_id":"6"},{"events":14647,"late_share":0.0569,"on_time_share":0.9043,"route_id":"1"}],"routes":[{"events":14427,"late_share":0.0979,"on_time_share":0.4693,"route_id":"2"},{"events":7607,"late_share":0.0578,"on_time_share":0.4997,"route_id":"5"},{"events":7811,"late_share":0.046,"on_time_share":0.5433,"route_id":"3"},{"events":9885,"late_share":0.0725,"on_time_share":0.5586,"route_id":"4"}